# The Haxe program of the effects test: a ZynML module performs an effect
# whose handler calls back into this program. Rebuild with
# `haxe interview.hxml` (Haxe 4.3.6) from this directory, with
# src/zynml.zsnap present (a run of the zyntax tests writes it);
# interview.hl is checked in.
-cp src
-lib caribou
-main UseInterview
-hl interview.hl
